outer radius calcualted with CentralAxes.\\nvec is the vector describin the \
central axes of the heart, calculated with CentralAxes.\\n\\nOutput is het \
fiber angle matrix FAM = {9, slice, x, y} or {FAM, plot}.\\nThe angles are in \
degrees. \\n\\nHelixAngleCalc[] is based on DOI: 10.1186/1532-429X-17-S1-P15.\
\"\>", "InformationUsageText",
