   "ObjectType" -> "Symbol", "Usage" -> 
    "FinalGrads[grtxt,{int,intn},{rand,order}] finalizes the gradient txt \
file. \ngrtxt is the output from the function ConvertGrads, which convert the \
grad to txt format.\nint is True or False, if set to True it interleaves b=0 \
gradients every intn directions.\nrand indicates if the gradients need to be \
randomized, for this it uses the order which is the output of FindOrder.", 
    "Documentation" -> <|"Local" -> "paclet:QMRITools/ref/FinalGrads"|>, 
