initalization of the bayesian fit which comes from IVIMCalC, (without s0 \
using 3 compartments).\\nmask is the region in which the bayesian fit is \
performed.\\n\\noutput is {f1, f2, dc, pdc1, pdc2}. The fractions f1 and f2 \
