   "ObjectType" -> "Symbol", "Usage" -> 
    "DriftCorrect[data, bval] dirft corrects the data using the signals of \
the lowest bvalue that has 6 or more unique volumes.\nFor the function to \
work optimal it is best to have these volumes evenly spread througout thet \
data and for the first and last volume to have this low bvalue.\n\n\
DriftCorrect[] is based on DOI: 10.1002/mrm.26124.", 
    "Documentation" -> <|"Local" -> "paclet:QMRITools/ref/DriftCorrect"|>, 
